Subject: [PATCH 8/8] research/CODECS.md: ledger rows for codecs 33 (context
 rANS leaf) and 34 (16-bit image residual words)

Sizes measured at 1062b9e3 against the rc3 binary (17 PNM images, Silesia, OWID arrays; every
frame decoded and compared), rivals on the same pixels, and the indicative timings of the shared
review container. Both stay opt-in (KOLMO_NATIVE=rans).

Review R02, claims ctx-rans-leaf (#11) and img16-ctx-rans (#17).

